<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Roche Holding raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Roche Holding raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said it upgraded its intermediate-term rating on Swiss pharmaceutical company Roche Holding Ltd to buy from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- maintained a long-term buy rating on the stock.</p>
<p>-- further details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
